        Market-status pill. NASD: "doesn't have enough padding. Button not big
        enough like the design. It also isn't clickable to the market watch
        page." It was a <Badge> — px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs, about 110x22 and not a
        link at all. The design (Figma 155:11, "Frame 145") is 145x46 with 16px
        of horizontal padding, an 8px vertical, a 24px radius and an 11px status
        dot. It now matches, and it goes to OTC Market Watch.

        Not the shared Badge any more: those numbers are specific to this pill
        and resizing Badge would have moved every other badge on the site.
