rounded"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-3.5 text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-nasd-blue-600" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 5v11h4V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1M7 9V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-13a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V11a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zm0 7v-6H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5zm6 0h3V8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2z"/></svg><span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-current">Market Statistics</span></a></li><li class="hidden sm:block"><a href="/#flagship-products" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm whitespace-nowrap text-neutral-600 transition-colors hover:text-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" class="size-3.5 text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-nasd-blue-600" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4 9V3h8.028l-1.935 2.71a.5.5 0 0 0 0 .58L12.028 9zm0 1h9a.5.5 0 0 0 .407-.79L11.114 6l2.293-3.21A.5.5 0 0 0 13 2H3.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.5v11a.5.5 0 0 0 1 0z"/></svg><span class="border-b border-transparent group-hover:border-current">Flagship Products</span></a></li></ul><div class="ml-auto flex max-w-md flex-1 items-center"><label class="relative flex w-full items-center" aria-label="Site search"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="absolute left-0 size-5 text-neutral-400 sm:size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.73 14.436a6.5 6.5 0 1 1 .707-.707l3.416 3.418a.5.5 0 0 1-.637.764l-.07-.057zm-.71-.71q.385-.32.707-.706a5.5 5.5 0 1 0-.707.707"/></svg><input type="search" placeholder="Search anything" data-search-trigger readonly class="w-full cursor-pointer border-b border-neutral-200 bg-transparent py-1.5 pl-7 pr-2 text-sm text-neutral-700 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none sm:pl-6"></label></div></div></nav><main><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-nasd-blue-900 text-white"><!-- Base fill, then the texture at 15%, then the gradient at 40% --><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background: #242063" aria-hidden="true"></div><img src="/marketing/companies/admission/hero-texture.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full object-cover opacity-15"><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-40" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #110F30 0%, #2A2494 100%)" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-28 text-center"><div><span class="inline-flex rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white">Companies</span><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl mx-auto max-w-4xl">N-DSP Admission Process</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/80 mx-auto max-w-2xl italic">Access new sources of capital and connect with investors through the NASD marketplace. Our markets provide flexible admission routes designed to support companies at different stages of growth.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-8"><a href="#process" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-nasd-blue-900 min-w-60 justify-center border border-white/30 bg-white/10 px-8 py-4 text-base text-white backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/20 sm:text-lg">View Admission Steps</a><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-nasd-blue-900 min-w-60 justify-center bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base text-nasd-blue-900 hover:bg-neutral-100 sm:text-lg">Speak to Our Team</a></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-16" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><!-- About --><div class="pb-10 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1 lg:pb-12 lg:pt-6" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>About N-DSP (Digital Securities Platform)</h2><div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><p data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>N-DSP enables companies to issue and trade tokenized securities using blockchain technology. The platform brings issuers, investors, brokers and custodians onto a single regulated infrastructure, with faster settlement and a transparent record of ownership.</p><p data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>Admission follows the same regulated route as our other markets, with requirements set out for each type of participant.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden rounded-l-2xl border border-r-0 border-nasd-blue-100 bg-nasd-blue-50 lg:col-span-2 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 band-bleed lg:block" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl></div><!-- Best Suited for --><div class="order-3 rounded-2xl border border-nasd-blue-100 bg-nasd-blue-50 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:order-none lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:rounded-none lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent lg:py-10" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>Best Suited for</h3><ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 lg:max-w-md" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-3" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><span class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white text-nasd-red-500" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.25 3.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75V20.5h2v-2.75c0-.69.56-1.25 1.25-1.25h6.5c.69 0 1.25.56 1.25 1.25v2.75h2v-8.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-2a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-6a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75zM9 18v2.5h2.25V18zm3.75 0v2.5H15V18zm6.5 4H4.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-17A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6.25 2h8a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V9.5h1.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 20 11.75v9.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75M7.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 1 2 0a1 1 0 0 1-2 0m1 6a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m0-3.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2M12 5.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m0 7a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m3.5 0a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2M12 9a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2"/></svg></span><span class="text-sm text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>Tokenized securities issuance</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-3" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><span class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white text-nasd-red-500" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.25 3.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75V20.5h2v-2.75c0-.69.56-1.25 1.25-1.25h6.5c.69 0 1.25.56 1.25 1.25v2.75h2v-8.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-2a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-6a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75zM9 18v2.5h2.25V18zm3.75 0v2.5H15V18zm6.5 4H4.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-17A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6.25 2h8a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V9.5h1.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 20 11.75v9.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75M7.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 1 2 0a1 1 0 0 1-2 0m1 6a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m0-3.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2M12 5.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m0 7a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m3.5 0a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2M12 9a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2"/></svg></span><span class="text-sm text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>Digital asset financing</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-3" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><span class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white text-nasd-red-500" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6.25 3.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75V20.5h2v-2.75c0-.69.56-1.25 1.25-1.25h6.5c.69 0 1.25.56 1.25 1.25v2.75h2v-8.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-2a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-6a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75zM9 18v2.5h2.25V18zm3.75 0v2.5H15V18zm6.5 4H4.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v-17A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6.25 2h8a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V9.5h1.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 20 11.75v9.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75M7.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 1 2 0a1 1 0 0 1-2 0m1 6a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m0-3.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2M12 5.5a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m0 7a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2m3.5 0a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2M12 9a1 1 0 1 0 0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2"/></svg></span><span class="text-sm text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl>Forward-driven companies</span></li></ul></div><div class="relative order-2 mb-8 aspect-4/5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl lg:order-none lg:z-10 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:mb-8 lg:aspect-auto" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl><img src="/marketing/markets/about-trader-ndsp.webp" alt="Technology professional reviewing digital securities data on a tablet in a data centre" width="900" height="1100" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover" data-astro-cid-72muy2tl></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-neutral-50 py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-5 py-10 sm:px-8 sm:py-14"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-3xl">Requirements for Digital Assets Admission</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-600">Follow these simple steps to admit your company or security to the N-DSP platform, or join as a Market Participant.</p></div><div class="mx-auto mt-10 flex max-w-3xl flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 sm:gap-x-8" role="tablist" aria-label="Requirements for Digital Assets Admission" data-req-tabs><button type="button" role="tab" data-req-tab="0" aria-selected="true" class="border-b-2 border-transparent px-2 pb-2 text-base text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900 aria-selected:border-nasd-blue-900 aria-selected:text-nasd-blue-900 sm:text-lg">Issuers</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-req-tab="1" aria-selected="false" class="border-b-2 border-transparent px-2 pb-2 text-base text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900 aria-selected:border-nasd-blue-900 aria-selected:text-nasd-blue-900 sm:text-lg">Authorized traders</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-req-tab="2" aria-selected="false" class="border-b-2 border-transparent px-2 pb-2 text-base text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900 aria-selected:border-nasd-blue-900 aria-selected:text-nasd-blue-900 sm:text-lg">Custodians</button><button type="button" role="tab" data-req-tab="3" aria-selected="false" class="border-b-2 border-transparent px-2 pb-2 text-base text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:text-neutral-900 aria-selected:border-nasd-blue-900 aria-selected:text-nasd-blue-900 sm:text-lg">Other Participating Institutions</button></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-6 mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl"><article role="tabpanel" data-req-panel="0" class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6"><ol class="divide-y divide-neutral-200 -mt-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">1</span><div><p>Complete <a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/N-DSP_FORM_1.docx" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">N-DSP Form 1</a>.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">2</span><div><p>Submit completed form and non-refundable fees payable in full at the time of application, accompanied by the listed supporting documents.</p><p class="mt-4"><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">Download the full admission document</a> to see supporting documents and payable fees</p></div></li></ol><div class="mt-auto flex justify-center pt-4"><button type="button" data-open-modal="admission-ndsp-issuer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-nasd-blue-600 bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-nasd-blue-900 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15 3.002a.5.5 0 0 0 .09-.992L15 2.002H4a.5.5 0 0 0-.09.992l.09.008zM9.5 18a.5.5 0 0 0 .492-.41L10 17.5L9.996 5.706l3.645 3.648a.5.5 0 0 0 .638.059l.07-.058a.5.5 0 0 0 .058-.638l-.058-.07l-4.492-4.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.255-.136L9.496 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.395.194L4.644 8.647a.5.5 0 0 0 .637.765l.07-.057l3.645-3.641L9 17.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5"/></svg>Submit N-DSP Admission Request</button></div></article><article role="tabpanel" data-req-panel="1" hidden class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6"><ol class="divide-y divide-neutral-200 -mt-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">1</span><div><p>Complete <a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/Draft_N-DSP_Form_2b-_Registration_as_an_Authorised_Trader.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">N-DSP Form 2b</a> — registration as an authorised trader.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">2</span><div><p>Submit the completed form with the applicable registration fee.</p><p class="mt-4"><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">Download the full admission document</a> to see supporting documents and payable fees</p></div></li></ol><div class="mt-auto flex justify-center pt-4"><button type="button" data-open-modal="admission-ndsp-authorised-trader" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-nasd-blue-600 bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-nasd-blue-900 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15 3.002a.5.5 0 0 0 .09-.992L15 2.002H4a.5.5 0 0 0-.09.992l.09.008zM9.5 18a.5.5 0 0 0 .492-.41L10 17.5L9.996 5.706l3.645 3.648a.5.5 0 0 0 .638.059l.07-.058a.5.5 0 0 0 .058-.638l-.058-.07l-4.492-4.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.255-.136L9.496 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.395.194L4.644 8.647a.5.5 0 0 0 .637.765l.07-.057l3.645-3.641L9 17.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5"/></svg>Submit N-DSP Admission Request</button></div></article><article role="tabpanel" data-req-panel="2" hidden class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6"><ol class="divide-y divide-neutral-200 -mt-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">1</span><div><p>Complete <a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NDSP_FORM_4A_-_CUSTODIAN_REGISTRATION_FORM.docx" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">N-DSP Form 4a</a> — custodian registration.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">2</span><div><p>Submit the completed form with supporting documents.</p><p class="mt-4"><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">Download the full admission document</a> to see supporting documents and payable fees</p></div></li></ol><div class="mt-auto flex justify-center pt-4"><button type="button" data-open-modal="admission-ndsp-custodian" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-nasd-blue-600 bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-nasd-blue-900 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15 3.002a.5.5 0 0 0 .09-.992L15 2.002H4a.5.5 0 0 0-.09.992l.09.008zM9.5 18a.5.5 0 0 0 .492-.41L10 17.5L9.996 5.706l3.645 3.648a.5.5 0 0 0 .638.059l.07-.058a.5.5 0 0 0 .058-.638l-.058-.07l-4.492-4.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.255-.136L9.496 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.395.194L4.644 8.647a.5.5 0 0 0 .637.765l.07-.057l3.645-3.641L9 17.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5"/></svg>Submit N-DSP Admission Request</button></div></article><article role="tabpanel" data-req-panel="3" hidden class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6"><ol class="divide-y divide-neutral-200 -mt-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">1</span><div><p>Complete <a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/Draft_N-DSP_FORM_2A_-_PI_Registration_Form_2023_.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">N-DSP Form 2a</a> — participating institution registration.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700"><span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-nasd-red-500 text-2xs font-medium leading-none text-nasd-red-500">2</span><div><p>Submit completed form and non-refundable fees payable in full at the time of application.</p><p class="mt-4"><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">Download the full admission document</a> to see supporting documents and payable fees</p></div></li></ol><div class="mt-auto flex justify-center pt-4"><button type="button" data-open-modal="admission-ndsp-participating-institution" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-nasd-blue-600 bg-white px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-nasd-blue-900 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15 3.002a.5.5 0 0 0 .09-.992L15 2.002H4a.5.5 0 0 0-.09.992l.09.008zM9.5 18a.5.5 0 0 0 .492-.41L10 17.5L9.996 5.706l3.645 3.648a.5.5 0 0 0 .638.059l.07-.058a.5.5 0 0 0 .058-.638l-.058-.07l-4.492-4.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.255-.136L9.496 4a.5.5 0 0 0-.395.194L4.644 8.647a.5.5 0 0 0 .637.765l.07-.057l3.645-3.641L9 17.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5.5"/></svg>Submit N-DSP Admission Request</button></div></article></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl"><div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><img src="/logos/nasd-mark.png" alt="" width="16" height="16" loading="lazy" class="size-4 shrink-0 object-contain"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">N-DSP Listing Requirements Document</h3></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-700"><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="text-nasd-blue-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-nasd-blue-500">Download the full admission document</a> for detailed disclosure requirements and obligations.</p></div></div></div></div></section><script type="module">for(let e of document.querySelectorAll(`[data-req-tabs]`)){let t=e.closest(`section`)?.querySelectorAll(`[data-req-panel]`)??[];e.addEventListener(`click`,n=>{let r=n.target.closest(`[data-req-tab]`);if(!r)return;let i=r.getAttribute(`data-req-tab`);for(let t of e.querySelectorAll(`[data-req-tab]`))t.setAttribute(`aria-selected`,t===r?`true`:`false`);for(let e of t)e.hidden=e.getAttribute(`data-req-panel`)!==i})}</script><div id="process"><section class="bg-neutral-50 py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">Company Admission Process</h2><p class="mt-3 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg">Follow these steps to admit your company or security to the NASD Digital Securities Platform.</p></div><ol class="relative grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-10 mx-auto mt-14 max-w-4xl sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-24 sm:gap-y-24"><li class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-1"><div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-neutral-200"><span class="flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-nasd-red-100 text-nasd-red-600"></span></div><div class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-nasd-red-500">Step 1</div><h3 class="mt-2 max-w-[18ch] text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">Pre-Admission</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-[26ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Board appoints Issuing House, fills application, and returns with fee. Board submits signed undertaking and supporting documents.</p><span class="pointer-events-none absolute top-12 hidden text-nasd-blue-300 sm:block" style="left: calc(100% + 1rem)" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="96" height="24" viewBox="0 0 96 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><title>Next step</title><path d="M2 12 C 12 2, 28 22, 40 12 S 72 2, 84 12"></path><path d="M78 7 l 6 5 l -6 5"></path></svg></span></li><li class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:col-start-2 sm:row-start-1"><div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-neutral-200"><span class="flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-nasd-blue-100 text-nasd-blue-600"></span></div><div class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-nasd-red-500">Step 2</div><h3 class="mt-2 max-w-[18ch] text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">Review</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-[26ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">NASD will review company structure. After due diligence, NASD will give approval in principle.</p><span class="pointer-events-none absolute hidden text-nasd-blue-300 sm:block" style="top: calc(100% + 0.5rem); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%)" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="96" viewBox="0 0 24 96" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><title>Next step</title><path d="M12 2 C 2 12, 22 28, 12 40 S 2 72, 12 84"></path><path d="M7 78 l 5 6 l 5 -6"></path></svg></span></li><li class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:col-start-2 sm:row-start-2"><div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-neutral-200"><span class="flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700"></span></div><div class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-nasd-red-500">Step 3</div><h3 class="mt-2 max-w-[18ch] text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">Approval &amp; Admission</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-[26ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Company will open a register with CSCS. 100% dematerialization of shares can commence.</p><span class="pointer-events-none absolute top-12 hidden text-nasd-blue-300 sm:block" style="right: calc(100% + 1rem)" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="96" height="24" viewBox="0 0 96 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><title>Next step</title><path d="M94 12 C 84 2, 68 22, 56 12 S 24 2, 12 12"></path><path d="M18 7 l -6 5 l 6 5"></path></svg></span></li><li class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-2"><div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-neutral-200"><span class="flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="size-10" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15 4.25c0-1.08-1.274-1.651-2.08-.935L8.427 7.31a.75.75 0 0 1-.498.19H4.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2 9.748v4.497a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 2.25h3.68a.75.75 0 0 1 .498.19l4.491 3.993c.806.717 2.081.145 2.081-.934zM9.425 8.43L13.5 4.806v14.382l-4.075-3.623a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-1.495-.569H4.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75V9.748a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h3.68a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 1.495-.568m9.567-2.533a.75.75 0 0 1 1.049.156A9.96 9.96 0 0 1 22 12a9.96 9.96 0 0 1-1.96 5.947a.75.75 0 1 1-1.205-.893A8.46 8.46 0 0 0 20.5 12a8.46 8.46 0 0 0-1.665-5.053a.75.75 0 0 1 .157-1.05m-1.849 2.472a.75.75 0 0 1 1.017.302c.536.991.84 2.125.84 3.329a7 7 0 0 1-.84 3.328a.75.75 0 0 1-1.32-.714c.42-.777.66-1.667.66-2.615a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-.66-2.614a.75.75 0 0 1 .303-1.016"/></svg></span></div><div class="mt-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-nasd-red-500">Step 4</div><h3 class="mt-2 max-w-[18ch] text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">Announcement</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-[26ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Company announces admission to the NASD OTC Market. Trading on securities commences.</p></li></ol><div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2">View Detailed Admission Guidelines<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.837 3.13a.5.5 0 0 0-.674.74L16.33 9.5H2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h13.828l-6.165 5.628a.5.5 0 0 0 .674.739l6.916-6.314a.747.747 0 0 0 0-1.108z"/></svg></a><button type="button" data-open-modal="admission-ndsp-issuer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-nasd-blue-600 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-nasd-blue-600 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2">Submit N-DSP Admission Request<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10.837 3.13a.5.5 0 0 0-.674.74L16.33 9.5H2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h13.828l-6.165 5.628a.5.5 0 0 0 .674.739l6.916-6.314a.747.747 0 0 0 0-1.108z"/></svg></button></div></div></section></div><section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">FAQs</h2><p class="mt-3 text-base text-neutral-700 sm:text-lg">Some of the commonly asked questions you may have about N-DSP (Digital Securities Platform).</p></div><ul class="mt-10 divide-y divide-neutral-200 border-y border-neutral-200"><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What is the N-DSP Admission Process?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">It is the process for onboarding digital assets onto the NASD Digital Securities Platform.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What type of assets can be admitted?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Digital or tokenized securities approved by NASD.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Who can use the N-DSP platform?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Companies and issuers looking to offer digital securities.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What are the key benefits?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">It allows faster access to investors using digital infrastructure.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Are there specific compliance requirements?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Yes. Issuers must meet digital asset and regulatory standards prescribed by the SEC and NASD.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Do I need a technical partner?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">In many cases, yes, to support tokenization and setup.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>How is this different from traditional listing?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">It uses digital processes instead of manual or paper-based systems.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>Is investor access restricted?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Access may depend on the type of offering and approval level.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>What documents are required?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Issuer details, asset structure, and compliance documentation.</div></details></li><li><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-medium text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-nasd-blue-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><span>How do I start the process?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="size-5 shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.854 7.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .001.707l-5.465 5.484a.55.55 0 0 1-.78 0L4.147 8.353a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.706L10 12.812l5.147-5.165a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.001"/></svg></summary><div class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">Contact NASD or follow the onboarding steps on the platform.</div></details></li></ul></div></section><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-nasd-blue-900 py-20 text-white sm:py-28" data-astro-cid-btaervee><img src="/marketing/markets/cta-phone.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="1440" height="575" loading="lazy" class="closing-cta-pan absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full object-cover object-[center_42%]" data-cta-pan data-astro-cid-btaervee><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-nasd-blue-900/40" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-btaervee></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-astro-cid-btaervee><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center" data-astro-cid-btaervee><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl" data-astro-cid-btaervee>Ready to Take the Next Step?</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-white/90 sm:text-lg" data-astro-cid-btaervee>Speak with our team to explore the right market for your company.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3" data-astro-cid-btaervee><a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-nasd-blue-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white ring-1 ring-white/25 transition-colors hover:bg-nasd-blue-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-nasd-blue-900" data-astro-cid-btaervee>Speak with our team</a><a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-web/documents/library/NASD-N-DSP-Listing-Requirements.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-nasd-blue-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-nasd-blue-900" data-astro-cid-btaervee>Download Guidelines Overview</a></div></div></div></section><script type="module">var e=document.querySelectorAll(`[data-cta-pan]`);if(e.length){let t=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{for(let n of e)n.isIntersecting&&(n.target.classList.add(`is-visible`),t.unobserve(n.target))},{threshold:.25});for(let n of e)t.observe(n)}</script><dialog id="admission-ndsp-issuer" data-interest-modal class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 p-0 backdrop:bg-neutral-900/50" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><form action="/api/admission" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-ajax-form data-ajax-multipart data-success-reset class="flex min-h-0 w-full grow flex-col" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><!-- Title row --><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-neutral-200 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Submit N-DSP Admission Request</h2><button type="button" data-close-modal aria-label="Close" class="shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 text-neutral-400 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100 hover:text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="size-5" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir></path></svg></button></div><!-- Scrolling body. Only this scrolls: the dialog itself is overflow:hidden,
         otherwise the dialog and this element each render a bar — NASD:
         "There seems to be two scroll bar here as well. Lets make it one." --><div class="min-h-0 grow space-y-6 overflow-y-auto px-6 py-6 sm:px-8" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><input type="hidden" name="type" value="ndsp-issuer" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><div data-step="2" class="space-y-6" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>N-DSP Market Role</span><p class="mt-2 rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Issuer</p></div><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><label for="admission-ndsp-issuer-org" class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Organisation name <span class="text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="admission-ndsp-issuer-org" name="organisation" type="text" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/20" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><label for="admission-ndsp-issuer-first" class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Contact person first name <span class="text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="admission-ndsp-issuer-first" name="firstName" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/20" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir></div><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><label for="admission-ndsp-issuer-last" class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Contact person last name <span class="text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="admission-ndsp-issuer-last" name="lastName" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/20" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><label for="admission-ndsp-issuer-email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Email <span class="text-nasd-red-500" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="admission-ndsp-issuer-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/20" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir></div><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><label for="admission-ndsp-issuer-phone" class="block text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Phone number</label><input id="admission-ndsp-issuer-phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" pattern="[+\(\)0-9][0-9 \(\)+\-]{6,19}" title="Digits only, optionally with + ( ) - and spaces" placeholder="+234 XXX" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-neutral-900 placeholder:text-neutral-400 focus:border-nasd-blue-600 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-nasd-blue-600/20" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir></div></div><!-- The signed NASD form --><div data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>N-DSP Form 1</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-700" data-astro-cid-wa7lqhir>Please upload the signed and completed N-DSP Form 1.<a href="https://nasdspace.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/nasd-we